:987a817de9003439"}," with a Kasha Crystal, you gain a +2 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force"}," bonus to your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Will Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Will_Defense"},".\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
